<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=5.0, minimum-scale=1.0">
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="ie=edge">
    <meta name="Description" content="Dwayne Codling — Head of Development, people-first leader, and D&I advocate based in Nottingham, UK.">
    <meta name="keywords" content="head of development, leadership, Nottingham, Jamaica, tech leader, D&I advocate">
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary" />
    <meta name="twitter:creator" content="@codling" />
    <meta property="og:title" content="Dwayne Codling" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="Head of Development. People-first leader. D&I advocate." />
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://dwaynecodling.com/assets/img/share/dwayne-share.jpg" />
    <meta property="og:image:width" content="1200" />
    <meta property="og:image:height" content="630" />
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://dwaynecodling.com/" />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://dwaynecodling.com/" />
    <title>Dwayne Codling — Head of Development &amp; Leadership Coach</title>
    <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "Person",
      "name": "Dwayne Codling",
      "url": "https://dwaynecodling.com",
      "jobTitle": "Head of Development",
      "description": "Head of Development, people-first leader, and D&I advocate based in Nottingham, UK.",
      "image": "https://dwaynecodling.com/assets/img/share/dwayne-share.jpg",
      "sameAs": [
        "https://x.com/codling",
        "https://www.linkedin.com/in/dwayne-codling/",
        "https://github.com/dwaynecodling",
        "https://www.instagram.com/dwaynecodling.fitness"
      ]
    }
    </script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "Organization",
      "name": "Dwayne Codling",
      "url": "https://dwaynecodling.com",
      "logo": "https://dwaynecodling.com/assets/img/share/dwayne-share.jpg",
      "description": "Head of Development, people-first leader, and D&I advocate.",
      "jobTitle": "Head of Development",
      "sameAs": [
        "https://x.com/codling",
        "https://www.linkedin.com/in/dwayne-codling/",
        "https://github.com/dwaynecodling"
      ],
      "areaServed": "GB",
      "contactPoint": {
        "@type": "ContactPoint",
        "contactType": "Customer Service",
        "email": "dwayneandrecodling@gmail.com"
      }
    }
    </script>
    <%- include("../partials/links") %>
    <link rel="preload" as="image" type="image/avif" imagesrcset="/assets/img/pages/home/dwayne-portrait@600w.avif 600w, /assets/img/pages/home/dwayne-portrait.avif 1000w" imagesizes="(max-width: 61.99em) 80vw, 480px" fetchpriority="high">
</head>
<body>
<%- include("../partials/nav") %>

<main id="main-content" class="content" role="main">

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="m-bottom-0 p-0">
        <div class="hero hero--split">
            <div class="hero__content">
                <p class="hero__subheading"><span>Head of Development</span><span class="hero__sep" aria-hidden="true"> &middot; </span><span>Foundation Commerce</span></p>
                <h1 class="hero__heading">Hi, I'm <strong>Dwayne</strong>.<br>I build teams that last.</h1>
                <p class="hero__intro">Over a decade transforming how agencies grow; through great people, inclusive culture, and technology that delivers.</p>
                <div class="hero__cta-group">
                    <a href="/about-me" class="hero__button">
                        More about me
                    </a>
                    <a href="/contact-me" class="hero__button hero__button--outline">
                        Get in touch
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <picture class="hero__portrait">
                <source type="image/avif" srcset="/assets/img/pages/home/dwayne-portrait@600w.avif 600w, /assets/img/pages/home/dwayne-portrait.avif 1000w" sizes="(max-width: 61.99em) 80vw, 480px">
                <source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/img/pages/home/dwayne-portrait@600w.webp 600w, /assets/img/pages/home/dwayne-portrait.webp 1000w" sizes="(max-width: 61.99em) 80vw, 480px">
                <img src="/assets/img/pages/home/dwayne-portrait.jpg" srcset="/assets/img/pages/home/dwayne-portrait@600w.jpg 600w, /assets/img/pages/home/dwayne-portrait.jpg 1000w" sizes="(max-width: 61.99em) 80vw, 480px"
                     width="1000" height="1250" alt="Dwayne Codling smiling with his arms crossed" fetchpriority="high">
            </picture>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Three Pillars -->
    <section id="pillars">
        <div class="container">
            <article class="grid grid--list-of-3">
                <article class="grid__info">
                    <div class="info-snippet">
                        <span class="info-snippet__bg-text" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
                        <span class="info-snippet__accent"></span>
                        <h2 class="info-snippet__heading">Technology Leader</h2>
                        <p class="info-snippet__text">From frontend developer to Head of Development; over a decade guiding teams to do their best work, shipping great products, and building something that outlasts any single project.</p>
                    </div>
                </article>
                <article class="grid__info">
                    <div class="info-snippet">
                        <span class="info-snippet__bg-text" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
                        <span class="info-snippet__accent"></span>
                        <h2 class="info-snippet__heading">Champion of Inclusion</h2>
                        <p class="info-snippet__text">Diverse teams build better products. I've spoken at Tech Nottingham, DXN, and allyship events across the UK; because representation in tech isn't optional, it's essential.</p>
                    </div>
                </article>
                <article class="grid__info">
                    <div class="info-snippet">
                        <span class="info-snippet__bg-text" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
                        <span class="info-snippet__accent"></span>
                        <h2 class="info-snippet__heading">Powerlifter</h2>
                        <p class="info-snippet__text">Setbacks are part of the process; how you respond defines the outcome. I compete in raw powerlifting and apply that same resilience to everything I do.</p>
                    </div>
                </article>
            </article>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Strength Section -->
    <section class="m-bottom-0">
        <div class="strength-section">
            <div class="strength-section__image">
                <picture>
                    <source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/img/pages/home/dwayne-nottingham-strong@750w.webp 750w, /assets/img/pages/home/dwayne-nottingham-strong.webp 1440w" sizes="(max-width: 62em) 100vw, 50vw">
                    <img src="/assets/img/pages/home/dwayne-nottingham-strong.jpg"
                         srcset="/assets/img/pages/home/dwayne-nottingham-strong@750w.jpg 750w, /assets/img/pages/home/dwayne-nottingham-strong.jpg 1440w"
                         sizes="(max-width: 62em) 100vw, 50vw"
                         alt="Dwayne Codling standing tall at deadlift lockout at Nottingham Strong"
                         loading="lazy" />
                </picture>
            </div>
            <div class="strength-section__content">
                <p class="strength-section__label">Beyond the work</p>
                <h2 class="strength-section__heading">Forward ever,<br>backward never.</h2>
                <p class="strength-section__text">Eight weeks after a rotator cuff injury, I totalled 522.5kg at Nottingham Strong: 7th of 49 overall and 2nd in my Masters group. What made it meaningful wasn't the result; it was the comeback. The same mindset I bring to the platform, I bring to leadership.</p>
                <div class="strength-section__stats">
                    <div class="strength-section__stat">
                        <span class="strength-section__stat-value">522.5kg</span>
                        <span class="strength-section__stat-label">Total</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="strength-section__stat">
                        <span class="strength-section__stat-value">7th</span>
                        <span class="strength-section__stat-label">of 49 overall</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="strength-section__stat">
                        <span class="strength-section__stat-value">2nd</span>
                        <span class="strength-section__stat-label">Masters 40&ndash;49</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <%- include("../partials/latest_posts", {posts: otherArticles}) %>
</main>

<%- include("../partials/footer") %>
</body>
</html>
